        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Just wanted to be sure on this. The only way to trigger the Game Over condition is to remove it via reducing it to 0 HPs, right?</p><p>Simply removing it from playing, Grappling Hook, etc., doesn&#39;t trigger the game over condition.</p><p>We didn&#39;t think there was any kind of &quot;If this card is removed from play, it is automatically reduced to 0 HPs first&quot; or anything like that. But wanted to be sure.</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
